{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38858","headline":"送福昌周繇少府归宁兼谋隐 · 杜荀鹤","name":"送福昌周繇少府归宁兼谋隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少见古人无远虑，如君真得古人情。\n登科作尉官虽小，避世安亲禄已荣。\n一路水云生隐思，几山猿鸟认吟声。\n知君未作终焉计，要着文章待太平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}